<title>USA: Synergistic delisted from Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>Synergistic delisted from Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Synergistic Holdings Corp said Tuesday that its stock was deleted from the Nasdaq stock market effective April 16.</p>
<p>Salvatore Crimi, chief executive officer, said the company will apply to trade the stock on the over-the-counter bulletin board.</p>
<p>Synergistic, an automobile asset management and insurance claims servicer, is considering numerous alternatives to enhance shareholder value and improve its flexibility, including future financing, he said.</p>
